d to delete the section altogether, simply select the section and hit the Delete or backspace button on your keyboard."," "]})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("details",{className:tv,children:[(0,n.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("span",{className:tA,id:"15-what-are-the-text-options-for-my-online-whiteboard",children:"What are the text options for my online whiteboard?"})," ",(0,n.jsx)(tT.k,{className:tx})]}),(0,n.jsx)("p",{children:"Whether creating a text box or editing text on an object, sticky note, or shape, a text toolbar will appear, allowing you to change the text properties. On the toolbar, you can update the following properties:"}),(0,n.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("strong",{children:"Typeface."})," Simple, bookish, technical, and scribbled are the four types of FigJam fonts you can choose to match the style of your board."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("strong",{children:"Text size."})," Choose between the small, medium, large, extra large, or huge preset text sizes, or customize your font size by inputting a specific point size."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("strong",{children:"Bold and strikethrough."})," You can apply the bold property to help text stand out or the strikethrough property to cross off tasks or ideas during meetings or brainstorming sessions."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("strong",{children:"Lists."})," Create bulleted lists or numbered lists to organize to-do lists, notes, or instructions on your board."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("strong",{children:"Text color."})," Make text pop by changing the font color to any of the color options in the dropdown on the toolbar."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("strong",{children:"Alignment."})," Align text to the left, right, or center using the alignment option in the text toolbar."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("strong",{children:"Links."})," Add clickable links to other FigJam boards, documen