Name:tx})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("p",{children:["Rotating and resizing uploaded image files on your whiteboard is simple. To resize an image, click and drag the bounding box around the image to get it to your desired proportions. To rotate the image, click the file, then hit the Crop image button that's located on the popup toolbar. From there, you can rotate the image or change its aspect ratio."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can also bring Figma designs into FigJam with the ability to move, flip, rotate, or rearrange the objects on your board."," ",(0,n.jsx)(tb.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/1500005916661-Work-between-Figma-and-FigJam",children:"Learn more about working between Figma and FigJam"}),"."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("p",{children:["Adding images and design files to your FigJam whiteboard can make it easy to check in on design progress during team meetings or add personalization to mood boards, team chats, and brainstorming sessions."," "]})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("details",{className:tv,children:[(0,n.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("span",{className:tA,id:"18-do-the-online-whiteboards-have-undoredo-functionality",children:"Do the online whiteboards have undo/redo functionality?"})," ",(0,n.jsx)(tT.k,{className:tx})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam's online whiteboard has both undo and redo functionalities, making it quick and easy to reverse or repeat actions."," "]}),(0,n.jsxs)("p",{children:["To undo an action, use the Command + Z shortcut on your keyboard or click Edit, then Undo on the top left menu bar. To redo actions, hit Command + Shift + Z on your keyboard, or select Edit then Redo in the menu bar."," "]})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("details",{className:tv,children:[(0,n.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,n.jsx)("span",{className:tA,id:"20-how-can-i-add-text-to-my-whiteboard",children:"How can I add text to my whiteboard?"})," ",(0,n.jsx)(tT.k,{className:tx})]}),(0,n.jsxs)("p",{children:["To add text to your whiteboard, click the Text button on the bottom t